6673738\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/6ffac9a099b0f19cca8f63afb1bffed3.webm?t=1776673738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/6ffac9a099b0f19cca8f63afb1bffed3.mp4?t=1776673738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Product Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Romance – An Immersive First-Person Love Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See, feel, and awkwardly fumble your way through a fully acted romantic adventure told from your own eyes. Every glance, blush, and silent stare is your moment to shine—or completely misread the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices, Your Fate – Multiple Endings, Hidden Surprises</strong>  <br>There’s no “right” answer—just the path you choose. Shape your destiny through heartfelt decisions, unlock secret scenes, and discover endings that prove every heartbreak was <i>totally worth it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Realism Starring</strong> <strong>Some of Asia's Most Popular Content Creators</strong><br>This isn’t just a game—it’s a live-action, fully performed experience. Featuring real influencers, real emotions, and real palm trees. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Choices – Clues, Exploration, and Mini Games</strong><br>Because sometimes, love requires solving puzzles, finding clues, or winning a mini game that makes zero sense but somehow matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Will You Choose?</strong><br>Sweet, shy, bold, mysterious, alluring, or dazzlingly unpredictable—choose wisely. Or don’t. You’ll probably still mess it up somehow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4Divinity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We publish games. Sometimes romantic, sometimes action-packed, sometimes both. Either way, we bring great stories from Asia to the world—and occasionally to deserted islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Titan Digital Media</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creative brains (and faces) behind this adventure. Known for their influencer-driven storytelling, Titan brings the drama, charm, and probably the bloopers too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island of Hearts</strong> is a live-action interactive romance set on a breathtaking tropical island—where every choice matters, and sunscreen is optional.<br>    <br>Step into a first-person love story filled with heartfelt moments, awkward encounters, and just the right amount of chaos. Will you fall for the fiery rebel, the shy artist, the confident leader—or someone who completely derails your emotional stability?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/6405add2ec2938608e86f2aec13e20da.avif?t=1776673738\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras_big/6405add2ec2938608e86f2aec13e20da.avif?t=1776673738 width=1560 height=1072 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dialogue choices, actions, and emotional intelligence (or lack thereof) will shape your fate. There are multiple endings, hidden storylines, and probably at least one scene you’ll instantly regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your heart—or let fate do the heavy lifting. On this island, love isn’t just in the air—it’s in <i>every questionable decision you make</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emily</strong>