ploration, and Mini Games</strong><br>Because sometimes, love requires solving puzzles, finding clues, or winning a mini game that makes zero sense but somehow matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Will You Choose?</strong><br>Sweet, shy, bold, mysterious, alluring, or dazzlingly unpredictable—choose wisely. Or don’t. You’ll probably still mess it up somehow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4Divinity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We publish games. Sometimes romantic, sometimes action-packed, sometimes both. Either way, we bring great stories from Asia to the world—and occasionally to deserted islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Titan Digital Media</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creative brains (and faces) behind this adventure. Known for their influencer-driven storytelling, Titan brings the drama, charm, and probably the bloopers too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "After a rough breakup, you do what any reasonable person would: escape to a remote tropical island full of beautiful strangers. There, you’ll meet many captivating women, each with her own charm, secrets, and questionable taste in men. Your choices decide who you love, lose, or accidentally ghost.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Thai, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/e6a8eae383fa4ee9729b1ede8aa79c1f785086c0/header.jpg?t=1776673738", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/ef174d598ec239146139f93596dfea6afa2f80a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776673738", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/e